# From "Mission 15: Creation and Manifestation" (Wave V - Exploring
# Focus 15, CD3-5). Assumes Focus 15 already reached (climb-f12-f15.gws).
# The tape's own claim -- that this activates creative ability and manifests
# what's needed -- is kept as stated, not hedged.

@segment  mission-15-creation-and-manifestation
@title    Mission 15 — Creation and Manifestation
@levels   F15
@duration ~4m

say Focus 15 is a state of creation and manifestation. Here, you can reach what is, and know that intent alone puts your creative ability into action.
pause 8
say Be in the stillness that exists deep within you — the stillness between thoughts themselves, without thought.
pause 8
say Now, in this stillness, feel the energy around you. You are not separate from it.
pause 8
say Open your heart. Open your mind. Whatever you want to create or manifest in your life is available to you here.
pause 8
say Focus on what you desire, or what you need. Be open to receive it.
pause 6
say Explore this now.
hold 90
say You can return to this state simply by remembering the feeling of where you are right now.
pause 6
say From this point on, whenever you want to create a change or manifest a need in your life: inhale, remember this feeling, and say in your mind — plus create now. Plus manifest now. Then exhale.
pause 8
say Do this, and you activate your creative ability from within, with clear intent — manifesting what's needed for your higher purpose.
pause 8
say The more you practice this, the easier and more effective it becomes.
pause 6
